        <item>
            <title>1.0.55</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>
<strong>Beta release</strong> — please send feedback from Help › Send Feedback.
</p>
<h3>What's new</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Quick reply.</strong> Every conversation now has a reply box at the bottom. Type and press ⌘Return or <strong>Send</strong>. You still get the few seconds to undo, and undoing opens your reply in a full compose window. Switch between Reply and Reply All with the arrow button on the left, or move to a full compose window with the expand button.</li>
<li><strong>Reply from notifications.</strong> New-mail notifications now have <strong>Reply</strong> and <strong>Mark as Read</strong> buttons, so you can answer without opening Normal Mail.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
